WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:04,250
little lady

2
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:09,630
The big boss is very good-looking, I know it

3
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:14,690
My sister is not the kind of person who loves love.

4
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:18,910
Tissue paper, wet wipes, toothpaste and soap

5
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:20,310
A shelf of daily necessities

6
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:23,510
Electric drill and backhand screw tool

7
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:27,310
Instant noodles, screw noodles, potato starch, hot pot vegetarian food

8
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:28,710
A rack of rice, flour, grains and oils

9
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:30,110
Enough to feed me for half a year

10
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:32,510
There is also a shelf of compressed biscuits and other survival supplies.

11
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:34,710
Eat sparingly, enough for more than a year

12
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:37,110
Plus these things I hoarded after the apocalypse

13
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:39,510
The total should be enough for me to eat for two years.

14
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,640
Two years and I still don’t feel safe

15
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,040
I have to find opportunities to continue stocking up.

16
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:50,010
So my sister likes me the most, right?

17
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:54,120
If I remember correctly, he is a bilingual child.

18
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,920
If you don't say that you like her

19
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:58,120
You can really cry for me, huh?
